<div data-toggle-group="mainmenu" data-toggle-id="menu-show" data-toggle-class="rug-hidden-m--block" class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-16-24">
<div>
<div class="rug-panel--content rug-panel--content--border">
<h1 class="rug-mb-0 rug-clearfix">Frequently asked questions</h1>
</div>
<div id="target-content-holder"></div>
<div>
<figure class="rug-no-break rug-overflow-hidden rug-image--left__float rug-image--pw rug-image--pw__half">
<div class="rug-figure--image">
<img src="/education/bachelor/bachelor-open-day/images/image-large-faq.jpg" alt="decorative image" class=""></div>
</figure>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p>
<strong>Q: Can I bring my parent(s)/carer(s)?<br>
</strong>A: Yes, you can bring 1 parent/carer, but please take care to book 2 places if you are planning to do so. Note: for some presentations there is a different maximum capacity per booking, this will be indicated upon booking.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: I did not receive a confirmation email, what should I do now?</strong>
<br>A: Have you checked your spam inbox? If you cannot find the email there either, then please send a message to <span class="js--decode" data-encoded="PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOnN0dWRpZWtpZXplcnNAcnVnLm5sIj5zdHVkaWVraWV6ZXJzQHJ1Zy5ubDwvYT4=">studiekiezers rug.nl</span>.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: The presentations I want to attend are fully booked; is there a waiting list?<br>
</strong>A: No, we do not work with a waiting list.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: The presentations I want to attend are fully booked; can I still come to the open day?</strong>
<br>A: At the Bachelor's degree programme information booths students and study advisors will be at hand to answer all your questions.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: Why is there an hour's break between presentations?</strong>
<br>A: The presentations take place in venues throughout the city. Everyone needs to have enough time to travel between venues. The schedule also factors in time for visiting an information fair and/or to have lunch. So even though this hour between presentations may not make sense if you stay in the same venue throughout the day, others do need that hour!</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: Can I chat to a student?<br>
</strong>A: Want to talk to someone about what it's like to be a student here? Find out more from one of our current students through our <a href="/education/chat-with-our-students">online chat system</a>.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: Where can I find more information on student life in Groningen?<br>
</strong>A: Learn about <a href="https://www.groningenlife.nl/" target="_blank">student life</a> at the University of Groningen, and find out more about all the exciting opportunities you will have while studying here. Our web page <a href="/cf/education/studentinfo/studyinleeuwarden">Why study in Leeuwarden?</a> offers more information on studying at our faculty in Leeuwarden, Campus Frysl&acirc;n.<br>A: Read our <a href="/education/student-blog/?lang=en">blog</a> to discover what life as a UG student is like, and to get some great tips about how to make the most of your time here.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: Where can I find more information on studying with special needs?<br>
</strong>A: Do you experience barriers due to a functional impairment (disability) or illness? Do you perhaps have a caretaker&rsquo;s role or do you want to combine your studies with top-class sport, entrepreneurship or parenthood? Take a look at our <a href="/education/student-service-centre/bijzondere-omstandigheden/studying-with-special-needs/">website about studying with special needs</a>.</p>
<p>
<strong>Q: I have a different question!<br>
</strong>A: In that case, you can email us at <span class="js--decode" data-encoded="PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOnN0dWRpZWtpZXplcnNAcnVnLm5sIj5zdHVkaWVraWV6ZXJzQHJ1Zy5ubDwvYT4=">studiekiezers rug.nl</span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-mb-xm">
<a href="/education/bachelor/bachelor-open-day/" class="rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--medium rug-mr-s rug-button__grid-two">Return to rug.nl/openday<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
</div>
